# Git tracks text, evidence and baselines. Blender files and run directories (renders go to runs/renders/) are
# regenerated by the pipeline and stay out. work/<task>/ text and study code are tracked on its task branch
# (its .blend files are not) and deleted before the squash onto main.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.blend
*.blend[0-9]*
**/milestones/
runs/
.venv/
.wayfarer-write.lock
.wayfarer-stages.json
.claude/settings.local.json
godot/.godot/
godot/generated/
CLAUDE.local.md
# Maintainer-local: Drive workbook captures, owner correspondence and internal review notes are never published.
references/drive_capture_*/
references/OWNER_*
references/*.md
